{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your utility belt \u2014 it\u2019s time to go foraging.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forager's Finds</i> is a relaxed exploration game where you head into a big, beautiful forest to find, photograph, and collect mushrooms. It's all about slowing down, spotting what's hidden in plain sight, and enjoying the simple satisfaction of discovering something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loads of species out there \u2014 some common, some rare \u2014 and it\u2019s your job to find them, learn about them, and build up your own personal journal of discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore a Lively, Open Forest</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through varied terrain \u2014 thick woods, gentle hills, damp clearings, rocky slopes. Every area has something different to offer. Some mushrooms are everywhere. Others? You\u2019ll need to look a little harder. Or higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><u>Your Foraging Tools</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got everything you need strapped to your utility belt:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera</strong> \u2013 Take photos of mushrooms in the wild. Every photo helps build your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Journal</strong> \u2013 Log what you find and where you found it. Over time, it becomes your go-to guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satchel</strong> \u2013 Pick and store your mushrooms to sell later. Limited space means smart choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map</strong> \u2013 Keep track of where you\u2019ve been and where you want to return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity Report</strong> \u2013 Unsure what you've picked? This gives you an idea of how rare it is.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell and Upgrade at Forager\u2019s Finds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your cosy forest shop, you can sell your mushrooms and use the money to get upgrades \u2014 like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger satchels</strong> \u2013 carry more before heading back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain boots</strong> \u2013 reach steeper, more remote areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful perks</strong> \u2013 improve your spotting skills or tracking abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take It Slow. Enjoy the Hunt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a race \u2014 it\u2019s a game about taking your time. Look closely. Pause often. Take in the sounds, the light, the movement. Whether you're hunting rare finds or just enjoying the calm of the forest, <i>Forager's Finds</i> is your space to explore, learn, and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902270?t=1772448473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/99d621cda31f8ce69cd925a140f033e601ac51cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772448473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/19041fd901c62ee50b3225cfe49a74b32d7b6521/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772448473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/19041fd901c62ee50b3225cfe49a74b32d7b6521/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772448473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3903040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your utility belt \u2014 it\u2019s time to go foraging.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forager's Finds</i> is a relaxed exploration game where you head into a big, beautiful forest to find, photograph, and collect mushrooms. It's all about slowing down, spotting what's hidden in plain sight, and enjoying the simple satisfaction of discovering something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loads of species out there \u2014 some common, some rare \u2014 and it\u2019s your job to find them, learn about them, and build up your own personal journal of discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore a Lively, Open Forest</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through varied terrain \u2014 thick woods, gentle hills, damp clearings, rocky slopes. Every area has something different to offer. Some mushrooms are everywhere. Others? You\u2019ll need to look a little harder. Or higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><u>Your Foraging Tools</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got everything you need strapped to your utility belt:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera</strong> \u2013 Take photos of mushrooms in the wild. Every photo helps build your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Journal</strong> \u2013 Log what you find and where you found it. Over time, it becomes your go-to guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satchel</strong> \u2013 Pick and store your mushrooms to sell later. Limited space means smart choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map</strong> \u2013 Keep track of where you\u2019ve been and where you want to return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity Report</strong> \u2013 Unsure what you've picked? This gives you an idea of how rare it is.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell and Upgrade at Forager\u2019s Finds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your cosy forest shop, you can sell your mushrooms and use the money to get upgrades \u2014 like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger satchels</strong> \u2013 carry more before heading back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain boots</strong> \u2013 reach steeper, more remote areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful perks</strong> \u2013 improve your spotting skills or tracking abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.poster.avif?t=1772448473\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.webm?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.mp4?t=1772448473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take It Slow. Enjoy the Hunt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a race \u2014 it\u2019s a game about taking your time. Look closely. Pause often. Take in the sounds, the light, the movement. Whether you're hunting rare finds or just enjoying the calm of the forest, <i>Forager's Finds</i> is your space to explore, learn, and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Grow Now!"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/249a9fdc51aebf055e02c3068928e455d99719e5/header.jpg?t=1772448473","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul